<section class="slide" data-num="07">
  <div class="slide-content">
    <div class="slide-title-row">
      <div>
        <div class="kicker">Remaining-challenges</div>
        <h2>Gaps persist where impact is incomplete</h2>
      </div>
      <p class="lede">Not all vaccine-preventable disease burden has been eliminated; access, supply, and trust remain system barriers.</p>
    </div>
