      <div class="challenge"><strong>Hepatitis A</strong><div class="big">89%</div><p>Case reduction; death reduction is 88.7%.</p><div class="bar-mini"><span style="width:89%"></span></div></div>
      <div class="challenge"><strong>Acute hepatitis B</strong><div class="big">83.9%</div><p>Case reduction; death reduction is 83.6%.</p><div class="bar-mini"><span style="width:83.9%"></span></div></div>
    </div>
    <div class="callout"><p>System priorities from the brief: improve global access, reduce supply shortages, strengthen scientific understanding, and support uptake.</p></div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="slide" data-num="08">
  <div class="slide-content">
    <div class="slide-title-row">
